OL,3,AUK threatens to ban Eritreans over
OL,4,Amigrant return policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FEritrea branded the move a "perfunctory
OL,7,Fpolitical gimmick", saying the UK had
OL,8,Fnot issued a single visa to an Eritrean
OL,9,Fofficial since 2023.
